    "identifier": "scattershot",
    "description": "<p>You load all your ammo into a single attack, looking to cause as fide spread destruction as possible. All creatures in a range of this jutsu, must make a Dexterity Saving Throw taking [Weapons damage] + 6dx on a failure and half as much on a success.  This Justus damage die is equal in size to the ammunition die spent as part of its casting.</p>\n<p>Chain 3: Instead of spending the full stack, you reduce its size by 1 step.</p>",
